(text "SN74AXC1T45 partial-power-down isolation: VCCA=AON, VCCB=CM4.\nUART stays high-impedance when either supply is off. DIR=0 for CM4 TX to C3 RX; DIR=1 for C3 TX to CM4 RX.\nOpen-drain reset, boot and final-halt outputs cannot back-power CM4 GPIOs." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid b7a96870-35ac-4055-8ad0-e256b6baaa1a))
